+fn edge_every_recorded_failure_points_at_a_line_of_its_own_program() {
+    // `Outcome` compares a failure by label and message and leaves the position
+    // out, because a `.rbc` carries no source text for the bytecode VM to
+    // render a column from. That makes the position unchecked by both halves of
